{"id":"815e63e5071e7b58","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","title":"Topological Space","display":"df-topological-space — Topological Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-topological-space","aliases":["58-df-topological-space","Topological Space","58-df-zfc-top3-topological-space","58-df-zfc-top6-topological-space"],"display":"df-topological-space — Topological Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-topological-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-topological-space</span><span>Topological Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-top3-topological-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-top6-topological-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-topological-space — Topological Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\)</span> (carrier set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (candidate topology, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological space predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topological\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_S(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal T\\land X\\in\\mathcal T\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topological\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_S(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal T\\land X\\in\\mathcal T\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Topology: collection of open sets</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-top3-topological-space</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-top6-topological-space</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li>Standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>: open balls generate</li>\n<li>Discrete/indiscrete: extreme topologies</li>\n<li>Continuous map: preimage of open is open</li>\n<li>Convergence and ZFC alias predicates are downstream atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32